comments.body:
@MilosKozak xDrip doesn't use Google services anymore as they shut down the service, they have setup their own service now at Bluejay project. All you need is to use the same key between master phone and follower phones and BG + data from AAPS will sync between the xDrip's flawlessly. Remote snoozing of alerts is also a neat feature :) And there is no need for the same google account anymore.
https://navid200.github.io/xDrip/docs/xDripSync.html

To be able to use AAPSClient properly you need NS anyway.
